# Peers

Public repos that pin at least two of the same prerelease lines as rat-stack. Found by `pnpm find-peers` (the `find-peers` skill). A repo stays on this list once seen; the Studied column links to what we learned from it.

Lines on 2026-09-23: `effect@4.0.0-rc`, `alchemy@2.0.0-beta`, `xstate@6.0.0-alpha`, `@xstate/effect@0.1.0-alpha`.

